              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nibaba nibaloba okhubukula eshikombe eshili mumukhonokwo, nokhunywa, kho olabasunjila mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI omwene mahe aboola, mbu Okhuula munywe. ",
          "type": "text",
