        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba lole, enjaaka okhukhola libii heetookho elikulishilwa khuliira lianje; neenyu mwakhachweya okhukuumwa noho? Mbula, shimulachweya okhukuumwa ta; okhuba ndalaIanjisia mbu olukanga lwitse khubamenyanga mushialo eshilamba, bosi pe; niIwo olwa OMWAMI omwene mahe aboola.",
